:"What our clients say"}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Testimonials_testimonialDesktop__XClcG","children":["$","$L25",null,{"testimonials":[{"text":"“KOTA are a lovely group of people with a great eye for design and detail. I've loved working with them so far, and I am sure they'll be partners for much more time to come!”","backgroundColor":"#d7e1d3","name":"Laura Wogan","speciality":"Third Generation Director","button":{"title":"View project","url":"https://kota.co.uk/work/wogan-coffee/","target":""},"logo":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/04/Wogan-Logo-White.svg","mediaDetails":{"width":169,"height":88}}},{"text":"\"The project was well managed from their end and we were immediately impressed by the quality of their designs and their interpretation of our brief. Following the launch, they still support us well with the maintenance of the site, helping to make quick fixes and small functionality tweaks. Nice bunch of people to work with too!\"","backgroundColor":"#f8e5cb","name":"Tangerine","speciality":null,"button":{"title":"View project","url":"https://kota.co.uk/work/tangerine/","target":""},"logo":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/11/tangerine-logo.svg","mediaDetails":{"width":233,"height":53}}},{"text":"\"KOTA were professional and supportive throughout our project. They are very skilled at what they do and excellent with all of their advice and clear communication. We are now a returning customer and wouldn't go anywhere else!”","backgroundColor":"#c4b5f3","name":"Danielle Crosby","speciality":"Futureform","button":null,"logo":null},{"text":"\"After launch, their support team didn’t miss a beat. Special thanks to Maja, who became our go-to during the post-design phase and handled everything with clarity and care, and to Nat, KOTA’s development lead, who responded to every request with efficiency and a positive attitude.\r\nWe were so impressed by the end result and ongoing support that we chose to stay with KOTA for hosting and utilise their SiteCare service—ensuring that our site continues to perform at its best long into the future.\"","backgroundColor":"#a8e1ec","name":"Shaun Obanion","speciality":"Social Media and PR Manager of Universal Production Partners","button":null,"logo":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/08/UPP-logo.svg","mediaDetails":{"width":64,"height":64}}}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Testimonials_testimonialMobile__B0_Aa","children":["$","$L25",null,{"testimonials":"$26"}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_relatedPosts__xfLkb","children":[["$","$L10",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_headingOuter__r3TEg","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_heading__3kOeH","children":["$","$L33",null,{"children":"Related Articles"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"RelatedPosts_viewAllLinkDesktop__db363","children":["$","$L33",null,{"delay":0.15,"children":["$","$L11",null,{"type":"a-internal","text":"View all articles","color":"white","href":"/blog"}]}]}]]}]}],["$","$L34",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","$L14","2236",{"className":"BlogPostCard_post__fNGbL BlogPostCard_small__j18h2","href":"/blog/sitecare-management-website-maintenance","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"BlogPostCard_postImage__Q4k_I","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"BlogPostCard_tags__RKboe","children":[false,[["$","span","Expertise",{"className":"BlogPostCard_tag__Dv5HS","children":"Expertise"}]]]}],["$","$L21",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/sitecare-header-image-1400x748.webp 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/sitecare-header-image-2000x1068.webp 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2024/02/